[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3492.93, "timestamp": "00:58:12", "text": "探索得快要死了，我中毒了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3506.19, "timestamp": "00:58:26", "text": "現在，尋找甲蟲不是我的強項，這是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3512.51, "timestamp": "00:58:32", "text": "學到的。如果你有這項技能，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3515.589, "timestamp": "00:58:35", "text": "就能找到它們，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3517.71, "timestamp": "00:58:37", "text": "但就"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3520.309, "timestamp": "00:58:40", "text": "我個人而言，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3523.51, "timestamp": "00:58:43", "text": "找不到。怎麼獲得經驗值？我肚子都快"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3530.829, "timestamp": "00:58:50", "text": "所有的一切，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3534.39, "timestamp": "00:58:54", "text": "甲蟲都會在這裡。如果真的有，我會很高興的。"}]